{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415802","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415802","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041580201:1":{"text":"일리아, 라이라. 나의 오랜 벗들이로군.","source_cn":"伊莱亚，莱拉。某的故友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26D2D0E4907978B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580202:1":{"text":"뭐라고요?","source_cn":"他在说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62F2AB388EE0F19F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580203:1":{"text":"벗이라고요?","source_cn":"故友？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39DB7F723DC0177","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580204:1":{"text":"라이라, 우리가 어떻게 악마의 오랜 벗이라는 걸까?","source_cn":"我们怎么会是恶魔的故友？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x815F03EE1824D859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580205:1":{"text":"그러게. 머리가 안 좋은 악마인가봐, 일리아.","source_cn":"他的脑子不太好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0584088457C85464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580206:1":{"text":"아니, 그대들은 분명 이 몸의 오랜 벗이다.","source_cn":"不。汝等与某确为故友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21097F06C85E659B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580207:1":{"text":"천 년 전, 그대들이 아직 은하수를 유영하던 시절, 스쳐 지나간 적이 있지.","source_cn":"千年前，汝等仍徜徉于星海，曾与某擦肩而过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6912533C272D1493","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580208:1":{"text":"당시 그대들은 아직 이 필멸의 육신을 지니지 못했었다.","source_cn":"彼时，汝等尚未获此凡躯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x198732F624AFEBE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580209:1":{"text":"당신도 별이라는 말이군요?","source_cn":"所以你也是一颗星星。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A0DF91BDF4DB453","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580210:1":{"text":"엄청 사악하게 생겼네요. 어떻게 이런 별이 있을 수 있죠?","source_cn":"看起来真邪恶。怎么会有这种星星？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFACFEE0BF0A69480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580211:1":{"text":"이 몸은 그대들보다 아득히 오래전부터 존재해 왔으며, 이 신분은 감히 비할 데 없이 존귀하다.","source_cn":"某之存在，远比汝等更久远；某之身份，远比汝等更煊赫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30F67DC59A0CF4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580212:1":{"text":"이 몸이 에스페리아에 강림한 것 역시 관측을 위해서지, 간섭하기 위해서가 아니리라.","source_cn":"某之降临于伊索米亚，亦为观察，而非干涉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0D0D75852145A28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580213:1":{"text":"라이라, 악마가 자기는 나쁜 짓을 안 한다고 말하고 있어.","source_cn":"莱拉，一个恶魔竟然说他不会做坏事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDEEBC844C4D83BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580214:1":{"text":"아까 머리가 좀 이상한 것 같다고 했잖아, 일리아.","source_cn":"我刚才说过他的脑子不太好，伊莱亚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x215643D88DF89D92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580215:1":{"text":"좁은 식견에 탄식만이 나오는군.","source_cn":"汝等眼界之狭隘，令某叹息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFE857AEE478E871","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041580216:1":{"text":"그대들의 세계는 티끌 한 점에 불과하다. 언젠가 그 세계도 또 다른 모습을 드러내겠지.","source_cn":"汝等之世界不过一粒微尘。终有一日，其将显露另一模样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB9A2E8C0653A98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041580217:1":{"text":"똑똑히 지켜보도록 하지.","source_cn":"某，拭目以待。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x674E80848FF2CD3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:星":{"text":"애스터","source":"星","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:伊莱亚":{"text":"일리아","source":"伊莱亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱拉":{"text":"라이라","source":"莱拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}